# Build context for the agent runtime image. The Containerfile only copies
# agent-runtime/, so everything else is weight — but two entries here are not
# about size.
#
# secrets/ must never enter a build context: a layer keeps whatever it was
# given even if a later step removes it, and this image is pushed to a
# registry other people can pull.
#
# .workspace/ is owned by the container's mapped UID after any local run, so
# `oc start-build --from-dir` cannot read it and the upload fails before it
# starts — with a permission error that reads like a cluster problem.

.git/
.github/
.workspace/
.replay/
.agent-status/
.fixtures/
secrets/
docs/
specs/
deploy/
scripts/
assets/
.cursor/
*.md
